#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/exposure/mode/mode.rst:2
msgid "Exposure Control Mode"
msgstr "露出制御モード"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/exposure/mode/mode.rst:4
msgid ""
":java:extdoc:`org.firstinspires.ftc.robotcore.external.hardware.camera.controls`"
msgstr ""
":java:extdoc:`org.firstinspires.ftc.robotcore.external.hardware.camera.controls`"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/exposure/mode/mode.rst:7
msgid "A webcam may operate in one of various exposure modes."
msgstr "ウェブカメラは、さまざまな露出モードのいずれかで動作することがあります。"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/exposure/mode/mode.rst:9
msgid ""
"Many common webcams offer only some of these modes. To directly control the "
"exposure, set the webcam to Manual mode."
msgstr ""
"多くの一般的なウェブカメラは、これらのモードのうちのいくつかしか提供していません。露出を直接制御するには、ウェブカメラをマニュアルモードに設定してください。"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/exposure/mode/mode.rst:12
msgid "The SDK supports these values of ExposureControl.Mode:"
msgstr "SDKは、ExposureControl.Modeのこれらの値をサポートしています："

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/exposure/mode/mode.rst:14
msgid "`AperturePriority`"
msgstr "`AperturePriority`"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/exposure/mode/mode.rst:15
msgid "`Auto`"
msgstr "自動"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/exposure/mode/mode.rst:16
msgid "`ContinuousAuto`"
msgstr "`ContinuousAuto`"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/exposure/mode/mode.rst:17
msgid "`Manual`"
msgstr "マニュアル"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/exposure/mode/mode.rst:18
msgid "`ShutterPriority`"
msgstr "`ShutterPriority`"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/exposure/mode/mode.rst:19
msgid "`Unknown`"
msgstr "不明"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/exposure/mode/mode.rst:21
msgid "Mode is managed with these ExposureControl methods:"
msgstr "モードはこれらの ExposureControl メソッドで管理されます："

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/exposure/mode/mode.rst:23
msgid "setMode(ExposureControl.Mode._mode_)"
msgstr "setMode(ExposureControl.Mode._mode_)"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/exposure/mode/mode.rst:24
msgid "getMode()"
msgstr "getMode()"

#: ../../source/programming_resources/vision/webcam_controls/exposure/mode/mode.rst:26
msgid ""
"The Logitech C920 and C270 models offer two exposure modes: AperturePriority"
" and Manual."
msgstr "Logitech C920およびC270モデルは、2つの露出モードを提供しています：AperturePriorityとManualです。"
